8	// is not "pick a spool I already have" is one step further away: the ⋯ menu on
9	// a row for editing it, and "Other spool…" for anything not in the list.
10	//
11	// The three steps (list, other-spool search, new-spool details) replace each
12	// other inside one popup rather than stacking popups, so there is one surface
13	// to dismiss and one keyboard model throughout.
